    {
      "id": "W7225707011",
      "doi": "10.1515/joc-2026-0485",
      "title": "PAPR-aware OFDM signalling for hybrid fibre–free-space-optical links: a comparative simulation study of companding and selected mapping",
      "authors": [
        "A B Gurulakshmi",
        "Muhannad Alshareef",
        "P. M. Siva Raja",
        "Cmak Zeelan Basha",
        "Abdullah Alwabli",
        "Arun Kumar"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Journal of Optical Communications",
      "venue_abbr": "J. Opt. Commun.",
      "rank_label": "未匹配 CIE 2023",
      "keywords": [],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1515/joc-2026-0485",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/dc630b8f-d3e4-4b0d-955d-5a3b4d388b24.html",
      "summary": "该蒙特卡洛仿真研究针对单模光纤串接Gamma–Gamma湍流信道的16-QAM DCO-OFDM，比较削波滤波、μ律压扩、选择性映射（SLM）及其混合方案。混合方案的峰均比降幅最大，但SLM的误码率增益最稳定，在所报FEC门限处获得0.3–0.8 dB的信噪比增益。压扩的接收端扩展会放大噪声，其优势随湍流增强而消失；强湍流条件下所有方案均未达到该门限。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
